+# seq
+
+`seq` is a Zig 0.15.2 CLI for mining Codex session/memory artifacts with Python-parity goals.
+
+## Toolchain
+
+```bash
+zig version  # expect 0.15.2
+```
+
+## Commands
+
+```bash
+zig build
+zig build run -- --help
+zig build test
+# Local fuzz attempt (CI/Linux is source of truth if macOS fuzz is unstable)
+zig build test --fuzz
+```
+
+## Status
+
+This repository is bootstrapped for the migration from `scripts/seq.py` to Zig with test-first development.
